<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When the fierce tempest, uplifting its waves,</l><l>Seeks to engulf us, we cry and He saves;</l><l>Looking to Jesus, upheld by His hand,</l><l>Tread we the billows as safe as on land.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>High are the cities that dare our assault,</l><l>Strong are the barriers that call us to halt;</l><l>March we on fearless, and down they must fall,</l><l>Vanquish’d by faith in Him far above all.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>His is the kingdom from pole unto pole,</l><l>Far above all while the ages shall roll,</l><l>With Him the victors, who follow’d His call,</l><l>Share in His royalty far above all.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
